* ============================================================================
*  BQ76952  3S-16S Li-ion battery monitor & protector - BEHAVIORAL MODEL
*  Target: ngspice (KiCad 7/8/9 built-in simulator). Plain SPICE + B-sources,
*  no XSPICE code models. Tested with ngspice-42 (all compatibility modes).
*  Built from TI datasheet SLUSE13B (Nov 2021). NOT a TI model.
*
*  Subcircuit pins are in PHYSICAL PIN ORDER 1..48 (TQFP-48 PFB), so a
*  KiCad symbol whose pin numbers match the datasheet maps 1:1.
*
*  MODELED
*   - 16 differential cell inputs (VCn - VCn-1), 2.1 Mohm load, inter-pin
*     ESD diodes, per-cell enable (CEn)
*   - Comparator protections: COV, CUV, OCC, OCD1, OCD2, OCD3, SCD with
*     programmable thresholds/delays and autonomous recovery
*   - Thermistor protections OTC/OTD/UTC/UTD on TS1..TS3 (18k pull-up to
*     REG18, beta-model NTC)
*   - Permanent fail: SOV/SUV, FUSE drive and FUSE sense
*   - Charge pump on CP1 (BAT+11 V or BAT+5.5 V, current limited)
*   - High-side NFET drivers CHG (turn-off to BAT) and DSG (turn-off to LD)
*   - Series-FET body-diode protection, PCHG/PDSG PFET drivers,
*     precharge / predischarge modes
*   - CFETOFF / DFETOFF / BOTHOFF pins, RST_SHUT (1 s -> SHUTDOWN),
*     wake on TS2 low or LD high, BAT POR with hysteresis, startup delay
*   - REG18, REG0 pre-regulator (BREG drives external NPN, REGIN ~5.5 V),
*     REG1/REG2 LDOs (45 mA, ~60 mA current limit)
*   - ALERT (open drain, low on any fault), DDSG/DCHG fault outputs
*   - Autonomous cell balancing (28 ohm internal FETs, start/stop delta),
*     paused for a 3 ms sampling window every CB_TS like the real IC;
*     protections use the sampled (unloaded) cell voltages while balancing
*  NOT MODELED
*   - I2C / SPI / HDQ (SCL, SDA, HDQ are high-Z), OTP/registers, ADC
*     quantisation & measurement-loop timing, SLEEP/DEEPSLEEP, open-wire
*     check, OCDL/SCDL latches & load-detect recovery, watchdog, FET
*     source-follower mode, DSG pulsed turn-off waveform (approximated by
*     a 50 ohm sink to VSS that stops at the LD level), balancing
*     adjacency/max-cell limits, temperature drift / accuracy spreads.
*
*  Settings are instance parameters (KiCad: Sim.Params), SI units:
*  volts, amps, seconds, degC. Current-based protection thresholds are
*  sense-resistor VOLTAGES, exactly like the IC (68m = 68 mV = 68 A @ 1 mOhm).
*  Defaults = datasheet Table 16-1 example 16S design.
*
*  Useful internal nodes to plot (prefix with the instance, e.g. XU1.):
*   cv1..cv16 cell voltages, vmax, vmin, isns (A, + = charge), t1..t3 (degC)
*   f_cov f_cuv f_occ f_ocd1 f_ocd2 f_ocd3 f_scd f_otc f_otd f_utc f_utd f_pf
*   rdy shut chg_ok dsg_ok chg_s dsg_s pchg_s pdsg_s b1..b16 (balancing)
*  All internal logic nodes are 0/1 V referenced to node 0.
* ============================================================================

*  PARAMETERS
*   CE1..CE16     1       cell n enabled (1) / unused-shorted input (0)
*   RSENSE        1m      sense resistor value, ohm (used for A-based settings)
*   OV_TH         4.30    COV threshold, V (50.6 mV steps on silicon)
*   OV_DLY        0.5     COV delay, s (3.3 ms steps)
*   OV_HYS        0.1     COV recovery hysteresis, V
*   UV_TH         2.50    CUV threshold, V (50.6 mV steps)
*   UV_DLY        20m     CUV delay, s
*   UV_HYS        0.1     CUV recovery hysteresis, V
*   OCC_TH        8m      OCC threshold, V across RSENSE (4-124 mV)
*   OCC_DLY       160m    OCC delay, s
*   OCC_REC       -0.2    OCC recovers when I < OCC_REC (A) for REC_TIME
*   OCD1_TH       68m     OCD1 threshold, V (4-200 mV)
*   OCD1_DLY      10m     OCD1 delay, s
*   OCD2_TH       56m     OCD2 threshold, V
*   OCD2_DLY      80m     OCD2 delay, s
*   OCD3_TH       28m     OCD3 threshold, V (0 = disabled)
*   OCD3_DLY      160m    OCD3 delay, s
*   OCD_REC       0.2     OCDx recovers when I > OCD_REC (A) for REC_TIME
*   SCD_TH        80m     SCD threshold, V (10..500 mV list)
*   SCD_DLY       50u     SCD delay, s (15 us steps)
*   SCD_REC       5       SCD recovery time, s
*   REC_TIME      3       generic protection recovery time, s
*   TS1_EN        0       TS1 thermistor measurement enabled
*   TS2_EN        0       TS2 thermistor measurement enabled
*   TS3_EN        0       TS3 thermistor measurement enabled
*   TS_R25        10k     thermistor R25, ohm
*   TS_BETA       3435    thermistor beta, K (Semitec 103AT)
*   OT_EN         1       OTC/OTD enabled
*   UT_EN         1       UTC/UTD enabled
*   OTC_TH        45      degC
*   OTC_DLY       2       s
*   OTD_TH        60      degC
*   OTD_DLY       2       s
*   UTC_TH        0       degC
*   UTC_DLY       5       s
*   UTD_TH        -20     degC
*   UTD_DLY       10      s
*   T_HYS         5       temperature recovery hysteresis, degC
*   SOV_TH        0       safety cell OV PF threshold, V (0 = disabled)
*   SOV_DLY       5       s
*   SUV_TH        0       safety cell UV PF threshold, V (0 = disabled)
*   SUV_DLY       5       s
*   FUSE_BLOW     0       1 = drive FUSE pin on PF
*   FUSE_PF_EN    0       1 = FUSE pin driven high externally causes PF
*   FET_EN        1       1 = autonomous FET control (0 = FETs held off)
*   SERIES        1       1 = series CHG/DSG FETs (body-diode protection on)
*   BD_TH         50m     body-diode protection current threshold, A
*   CP_EN         1       charge pump enabled
*   VCP           11      charge pump overdrive, V (11 or 5.5)
*   PCHG_EN       0       precharge mode enabled
*   PCHG_START    3.0     min cell below this -> charge through PCHG, V
*   PCHG_STOP     3.2     min cell above this -> leave precharge, V
*   PDSG_EN       0       predischarge enabled
*   PDSG_TO       0.5     predischarge timeout, s
*   PDSG_DELTA    0.5     predischarge ends when VC16-LD < this, V
*   CFETOFF_MODE  0       0 off, 1 active-high, 2 active-low
*   DFETOFF_MODE  0       0 off, 1/2 DFETOFF hi/lo, 3/4 BOTHOFF hi/lo
*   REG0_EN       1       REG0 pre-regulator (BREG/REGIN 5.5 V) enabled
*   REG1_V        3.3     REG1 output, V (0 = off)
*   REG2_V        0       REG2 output, V (0 = off)
*   CB_EN         0       autonomous cell balancing enabled
*   CB_START      40m     balance start delta (cell - min cell), V
*   CB_STOP       20m     balance stop delta, V
*   CB_MINV       3.9     minimum cell voltage to balance, V
*   CB_IDSG       50m     no balancing while discharging above this, A
*   RCB           28      internal balance FET resistance, ohm
*   CB_TS         0.25    measurement loop period (balancing paused 3 ms), s
*   TSTART        0.28    wake -> FETs enabled delay, s
*   VPOR          3.5     BAT power-on reset threshold, V
*   IQ            286u    NORMAL mode BAT current, A
*   RCIN          2.1Meg  effective differential cell input resistance
*   DDSG_EN       1       DDSG pin = DSG-fault logic output
*   DCHG_EN       1       DCHG pin = CHG-fault logic output
*   ALERT_EN      1       ALERT pin = open-drain, low on any fault
* ============================================================================

* ---- delay: out = in, but only after in has been high for TD seconds -------
.subckt BQ76952_DLY in out params: TD=1
Ct  t 0 1u
Bt  0 t I = V(in)>0.5 ? min(1u, 1u*(({2*TD}) - V(t))/({0.01*TD+1n})) : -1*V(t)
Bo  out 0 V = (V(in)>0.5) * 0.5*(1+tanh((V(t) - ({0.999*TD}))/({0.0003*TD+1n})))
.ends BQ76952_DLY

* ---- set/reset latch with clear (clr > set > reset > hold); inputs 0..1 ---
.subckt BQ76952_SR s r clr q
Cq  q 0 1n
Bq  0 q I = 1e-2*( (1-V(clr))*( V(s)*(1-V(q)) - (1-V(s))*V(r)*V(q) ) - V(clr)*V(q) )
+ + 1e-9*( 0.5*(1+tanh(20*(V(q)-0.5))) - V(q) )
.ends BQ76952_SR

* ---- transconductance LDO with current limit and off-state pull-down -------
.subckt BQ76952_LDO in out vss en params: VSET=3.3 ILIM=60m GM=5 VDO=0.5 RPD=2.5k
* en is a smoothed 0..1 signal; output current is scaled by it
Bp  in out I = V(in,out)>0 ?
+ V(en)*min(({ILIM}), max(0, ({GM})*(min(({VSET}), V(in,vss)-({VDO})) - V(out,vss)))) : 0
Bpd out vss I = (1-V(en))*V(out,vss)/({RPD})
.ends BQ76952_LDO

.subckt BQ76952 VC15 VC14 VC13 VC12 VC11 VC10 VC9 VC8 VC7 VC6 VC5 VC4 VC3
+ VC2 VC1 VC0 VSS SRP NC19 SRN TS1 TS2 TS3 REG18 ALERT SCL SDA HDQ CFETOFF
+ DFETOFF DCHG DDSG RST_SHUT REG2 REG1 REGIN BREG FUSE PDSG PCHG LD PACK DSG
+ NC44 CHG CP1 BAT VC16
+ params: CE1=1 CE2=1 CE3=1 CE4=1 CE5=1 CE6=1 CE7=1 CE8=1 CE9=1 CE10=1
+ CE11=1 CE12=1 CE13=1 CE14=1 CE15=1 CE16=1 RSENSE=1m OV_TH=4.30 OV_DLY=0.5
+ OV_HYS=0.1 UV_TH=2.50 UV_DLY=20m UV_HYS=0.1 OCC_TH=8m OCC_DLY=160m
+ OCC_REC=-0.2 OCD1_TH=68m OCD1_DLY=10m OCD2_TH=56m OCD2_DLY=80m OCD3_TH=28m
+ OCD3_DLY=160m OCD_REC=0.2 SCD_TH=80m SCD_DLY=50u SCD_REC=5 REC_TIME=3
+ TS1_EN=0 TS2_EN=0 TS3_EN=0 TS_R25=10k TS_BETA=3435 OT_EN=1 UT_EN=1
+ OTC_TH=45 OTC_DLY=2 OTD_TH=60 OTD_DLY=2 UTC_TH=0 UTC_DLY=5 UTD_TH=-20
+ UTD_DLY=10 T_HYS=5 SOV_TH=0 SOV_DLY=5 SUV_TH=0 SUV_DLY=5 FUSE_BLOW=0
+ FUSE_PF_EN=0 FET_EN=1 SERIES=1 BD_TH=50m CP_EN=1 VCP=11 PCHG_EN=0
+ PCHG_START=3.0 PCHG_STOP=3.2 PDSG_EN=0 PDSG_TO=0.5 PDSG_DELTA=0.5
+ CFETOFF_MODE=0 DFETOFF_MODE=0 REG0_EN=1 REG1_V=3.3 REG2_V=0 CB_EN=0
+ CB_START=40m CB_STOP=20m CB_MINV=3.9 CB_IDSG=50m RCB=28 CB_TS=0.25
+ TSTART=0.28 VPOR=3.5 IQ=286u RCIN=2.1Meg DDSG_EN=1 DCHG_EN=1 ALERT_EN=1

* ---- pin leakage / DC paths (keeps unconnected pins solvable) ----
Rlk_VC15 VC15 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC14 VC14 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC13 VC13 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC12 VC12 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC11 VC11 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC10 VC10 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC9 VC9 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC8 VC8 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC7 VC7 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC6 VC6 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC5 VC5 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC4 VC4 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC3 VC3 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC2 VC2 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC1 VC1 VSS 1G
Rlk_VC0 VC0 VSS 1G
Rlk_SRP SRP VSS 1G
Rlk_NC19 NC19 VSS 1G
Rlk_SRN SRN VSS 1G
Rlk_TS1 TS1 VSS 1G
Rlk_TS2 TS2 VSS 1G
Rlk_TS3 TS3 VSS 1G
Rlk_REG18 REG18 VSS 1G
Rlk_ALERT ALERT VSS 1G
Rlk_SCL SCL VSS 1G
Rlk_SDA SDA VSS 1G
Rlk_HDQ HDQ VSS 1G
Rlk_CFETOFF CFETOFF VSS 1G
Rlk_DFETOFF DFETOFF VSS 1G
Rlk_DCHG DCHG VSS 1G
Rlk_DDSG DDSG VSS 1G
Rlk_RST_SHUT RST_SHUT VSS 1G
Rlk_REG2 REG2 VSS 1G
Rlk_REG1 REG1 VSS 1G
Rlk_REGIN REGIN VSS 1G
Rlk_BREG BREG VSS 1G
Rlk_FUSE FUSE VSS 1G
Rlk_PDSG PDSG VSS 1G
Rlk_PCHG PCHG VSS 1G
Rlk_LD LD VSS 1G
Rlk_PACK PACK VSS 1G
Rlk_DSG DSG VSS 1G
Rlk_NC44 NC44 VSS 1G
Rlk_CHG CHG VSS 1G
Rlk_CP1 CP1 VSS 1G
Rlk_BAT BAT VSS 1G
Rlk_VC16 VC16 VSS 1G
Rsns SRP SRN 2Meg
Rld  LD VSS 2Meg
Rpk  PACK VSS 10Meg

* ---- cell inputs ----
.model BQ_DESD D(IS=1e-15 N=1 RS=10)
.model BQ_DREG D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
Rcin1 VC1 VC0 {RCIN}
Desd1 VC0 VC1 BQ_DESD
Bcv1 cv1 0 V = V(VC1,VC0)
Rcin2 VC2 VC1 {RCIN}
Desd2 VC1 VC2 BQ_DESD
Bcv2 cv2 0 V = V(VC2,VC1)
Rcin3 VC3 VC2 {RCIN}
Desd3 VC2 VC3 BQ_DESD
Bcv3 cv3 0 V = V(VC3,VC2)
Rcin4 VC4 VC3 {RCIN}
Desd4 VC3 VC4 BQ_DESD
Bcv4 cv4 0 V = V(VC4,VC3)
Rcin5 VC5 VC4 {RCIN}
Desd5 VC4 VC5 BQ_DESD
Bcv5 cv5 0 V = V(VC5,VC4)
Rcin6 VC6 VC5 {RCIN}
Desd6 VC5 VC6 BQ_DESD
Bcv6 cv6 0 V = V(VC6,VC5)
Rcin7 VC7 VC6 {RCIN}
Desd7 VC6 VC7 BQ_DESD
Bcv7 cv7 0 V = V(VC7,VC6)
Rcin8 VC8 VC7 {RCIN}
Desd8 VC7 VC8 BQ_DESD
Bcv8 cv8 0 V = V(VC8,VC7)
Rcin9 VC9 VC8 {RCIN}
Desd9 VC8 VC9 BQ_DESD
Bcv9 cv9 0 V = V(VC9,VC8)
Rcin10 VC10 VC9 {RCIN}
Desd10 VC9 VC10 BQ_DESD
Bcv10 cv10 0 V = V(VC10,VC9)
Rcin11 VC11 VC10 {RCIN}
Desd11 VC10 VC11 BQ_DESD
Bcv11 cv11 0 V = V(VC11,VC10)
Rcin12 VC12 VC11 {RCIN}
Desd12 VC11 VC12 BQ_DESD
Bcv12 cv12 0 V = V(VC12,VC11)
Rcin13 VC13 VC12 {RCIN}
Desd13 VC12 VC13 BQ_DESD
Bcv13 cv13 0 V = V(VC13,VC12)
Rcin14 VC14 VC13 {RCIN}
Desd14 VC13 VC14 BQ_DESD
Bcv14 cv14 0 V = V(VC14,VC13)
Rcin15 VC15 VC14 {RCIN}
Desd15 VC14 VC15 BQ_DESD
Bcv15 cv15 0 V = V(VC15,VC14)
Rcin16 VC16 VC15 {RCIN}
Desd16 VC15 VC16 BQ_DESD
Bcv16 cv16 0 V = V(VC16,VC15)
* measurement window: every CB_TS the device pauses balancing for 3 ms and
* samples all cells; while any cell is balancing, protections and balancing
* decisions use these samples (like the real IC), otherwise live values.
Vmwin mwin_p 0 PULSE(0 1 0 1u 1u 3m {CB_TS})
Bmwin mwin 0 V = V(mwin_p)>0.5 || time <= 0
Ch1 h1 0 1u
Bh1 0 h1 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv1)-V(h1)) : 0
Bcm1 cm1 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h1) : V(cv1)
Ch2 h2 0 1u
Bh2 0 h2 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv2)-V(h2)) : 0
Bcm2 cm2 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h2) : V(cv2)
Ch3 h3 0 1u
Bh3 0 h3 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv3)-V(h3)) : 0
Bcm3 cm3 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h3) : V(cv3)
Ch4 h4 0 1u
Bh4 0 h4 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv4)-V(h4)) : 0
Bcm4 cm4 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h4) : V(cv4)
Ch5 h5 0 1u
Bh5 0 h5 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv5)-V(h5)) : 0
Bcm5 cm5 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h5) : V(cv5)
Ch6 h6 0 1u
Bh6 0 h6 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv6)-V(h6)) : 0
Bcm6 cm6 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h6) : V(cv6)
Ch7 h7 0 1u
Bh7 0 h7 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv7)-V(h7)) : 0
Bcm7 cm7 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h7) : V(cv7)
Ch8 h8 0 1u
Bh8 0 h8 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv8)-V(h8)) : 0
Bcm8 cm8 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h8) : V(cv8)
Ch9 h9 0 1u
Bh9 0 h9 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv9)-V(h9)) : 0
Bcm9 cm9 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h9) : V(cv9)
Ch10 h10 0 1u
Bh10 0 h10 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv10)-V(h10)) : 0
Bcm10 cm10 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h10) : V(cv10)
Ch11 h11 0 1u
Bh11 0 h11 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv11)-V(h11)) : 0
Bcm11 cm11 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h11) : V(cv11)
Ch12 h12 0 1u
Bh12 0 h12 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv12)-V(h12)) : 0
Bcm12 cm12 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h12) : V(cv12)
Ch13 h13 0 1u
Bh13 0 h13 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv13)-V(h13)) : 0
Bcm13 cm13 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h13) : V(cv13)
Ch14 h14 0 1u
Bh14 0 h14 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv14)-V(h14)) : 0
Bcm14 cm14 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h14) : V(cv14)
Ch15 h15 0 1u
Bh15 0 h15 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv15)-V(h15)) : 0
Bcm15 cm15 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h15) : V(cv15)
Ch16 h16 0 1u
Bh16 0 h16 I = V(mwin)>0.5 ? 1e-2*(V(cv16)-V(h16)) : 0
Bcm16 cm16 0 V = (V(cbany)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(h16) : V(cv16)
Bvmax vmax 0 V = max((({CE16})>0.5 ? V(cm16) : -10), max((({CE15})>0.5 ? V(cm15) : -10), max((({CE14})>0.5 ? V(cm14) : -10), max((({CE13})>0.5 ? V(cm13) : -10), max((({CE12})>0.5 ? V(cm12) : -10), max((({CE11})>0.5 ? V(cm11) : -10), max((({CE10})>0.5 ? V(cm10) : -10), max((({CE9})>0.5 ? V(cm9) : -10), max((({CE8})>0.5 ? V(cm8) : -10), max((({CE7})>0.5 ? V(cm7) : -10), max((({CE6})>0.5 ? V(cm6) : -10), max((({CE5})>0.5 ? V(cm5) : -10), max((({CE4})>0.5 ? V(cm4) : -10), max((({CE3})>0.5 ? V(cm3) : -10), max((({CE2})>0.5 ? V(cm2) : -10), max((({CE1})>0.5 ? V(cm1) : -10), -10))))))))))))))))
Bvmin vmin 0 V = min((({CE16})>0.5 ? V(cm16) : 10), min((({CE15})>0.5 ? V(cm15) : 10), min((({CE14})>0.5 ? V(cm14) : 10), min((({CE13})>0.5 ? V(cm13) : 10), min((({CE12})>0.5 ? V(cm12) : 10), min((({CE11})>0.5 ? V(cm11) : 10), min((({CE10})>0.5 ? V(cm10) : 10), min((({CE9})>0.5 ? V(cm9) : 10), min((({CE8})>0.5 ? V(cm8) : 10), min((({CE7})>0.5 ? V(cm7) : 10), min((({CE6})>0.5 ? V(cm6) : 10), min((({CE5})>0.5 ? V(cm5) : 10), min((({CE4})>0.5 ? V(cm4) : 10), min((({CE3})>0.5 ? V(cm3) : 10), min((({CE2})>0.5 ? V(cm2) : 10), min((({CE1})>0.5 ? V(cm1) : 10), 10))))))))))))))))
Bisns isns 0 V = V(SRP,SRN)/({RSENSE})

* ---- power, reset, shutdown, startup ----
Bpor_s por_s 0 V = V(BAT,VSS) > ({VPOR})
Bpor_r por_r 0 V = V(BAT,VSS) < ({VPOR-0.18})
Vzero zero 0 0
Xpor por_s por_r zero pwr BQ76952_SR
Bnpwr npwr 0 V = V(pwr) < 0.5
Brst  rsth 0 V = V(pwr)>0.5 && V(RST_SHUT,VSS) > 0.9
Xrstd rsth sd_s BQ76952_DLY TD=1
Bwake wake 0 V = V(RST_SHUT,VSS) < 0.9 && (V(TS2,VSS) < 0.9 || V(LD,VSS) > 1.45)
Xshut sd_s wake npwr shut BQ76952_SR
Bact  act 0 V = V(pwr)>0.5 && V(shut)<0.5
Bnact nact 0 V = V(act) < 0.5
Xactd act act_d BQ76952_DLY TD={TSTART}
* startup window after t=0 (PWL source so ngspice gets a breakpoint)
Vtst  tst 0 PWL(0 0 {TSTART} 0 {TSTART+10u} 1)
Brdy  rdy 0 V = V(act_d)>0.5 && V(tst) > 0.5
* supply current
Biq   BAT VSS I = (V(act)>0.5 ? ({IQ}) : 1u) * min(1, max(0, V(BAT,VSS)/4))
* TS2 weak 5 V drive while in SHUTDOWN (wake circuit)
Bts2w VSS TS2 I = V(shut)>0.5 ? (min(5, V(BAT,VSS)) - V(TS2,VSS))/4.6Meg : 0

* ---- regulators ----
* smoothed (10 us) enables for the regulators
Racts act acts 10k
Cacts acts 0 1n
Xreg18 BAT REG18 VSS acts BQ76952_LDO VSET=1.8 ILIM=14m GM=1 VDO=1.0 RPD=10k
Bre0c re0c 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({REG0_EN})>0.5
Rre0  re0c re0 10k
Cre0  re0 0 1n
* REG0: proportional error amp (gain 10) driving the external NPN base;
* r0i = commanded BREG voltage (10 us pole, algebraic at DC)
Cr0   r0i 0 1n
Br0   0 r0i I = 1e-4*( V(re0)*min(max(0, V(BAT,VSS)-1.5), max(0, 6.15 + 10*(5.5 - V(REGIN,VSS)))) - V(r0i) )
Bbrs  BAT BREG I = V(re0)*min(3.33m, max(0, (V(r0i)-V(BREG,VSS))/1k))
Bbrk  BREG VSS I = V(re0)*min(1m, max(0, (V(BREG,VSS)-V(r0i))/1k))
Dregin REGIN BAT BQ_DREG
Bre1c re1c 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({REG1_V})>0
Rre1  re1c re1 10k
Cre1  re1 0 1n
Bre2c re2c 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({REG2_V})>0
Rre2  re2c re2 10k
Cre2  re2 0 1n
Xreg1 REGIN REG1 VSS re1 BQ76952_LDO VSET={REG1_V} ILIM=60m GM=5 VDO=0.5 RPD=2.5k
Xreg2 REGIN REG2 VSS re2 BQ76952_LDO VSET={REG2_V} ILIM=60m GM=5 VDO=0.5 RPD=2.5k

* ---- thermistors (18k pull-up from REG18 when enabled) ----
Bpu1 REG18 TS1 I = ({TS1_EN})>0.5 ? V(REG18,TS1)/18k : 0
Bt1 t1 0 V = 1/(1/298.15 + ln(max(1, 18k*max(1e-4,V(TS1,VSS))/max(1e-4, V(REG18,VSS)-V(TS1,VSS)))/({TS_R25}))/({TS_BETA})) - 273.15
Bpu2 REG18 TS2 I = ({TS2_EN})>0.5 ? V(REG18,TS2)/18k : 0
Bt2 t2 0 V = 1/(1/298.15 + ln(max(1, 18k*max(1e-4,V(TS2,VSS))/max(1e-4, V(REG18,VSS)-V(TS2,VSS)))/({TS_R25}))/({TS_BETA})) - 273.15
Bpu3 REG18 TS3 I = ({TS3_EN})>0.5 ? V(REG18,TS3)/18k : 0
Bt3 t3 0 V = 1/(1/298.15 + ln(max(1, 18k*max(1e-4,V(TS3,VSS))/max(1e-4, V(REG18,VSS)-V(TS3,VSS)))/({TS_R25}))/({TS_BETA})) - 273.15
Btmax tmax 0 V = max(max((({TS1_EN})>0.5 ? V(t1) : -100), (({TS2_EN})>0.5 ? V(t2) : -100)), (({TS3_EN})>0.5 ? V(t3) : -100))
Btmin tmin 0 V = min(min((({TS1_EN})>0.5 ? V(t1) : 200), (({TS2_EN})>0.5 ? V(t2) : 200)), (({TS3_EN})>0.5 ? V(t3) : 200))

* ---- primary protections (fault latches f_xxx) ----
* COV
Bc_cov c_cov 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OV_TH})>0 && V(vmax) > ({OV_TH}))
Xd_cov c_cov s_cov BQ76952_DLY TD={OV_DLY}
Bq_cov q_cov 0 V = V(f_cov)>0.5 && (V(vmax) < ({OV_TH-OV_HYS}))
Xr_cov q_cov r_cov BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_cov s_cov r_cov nact f_cov BQ76952_SR
* CUV
Bc_cuv c_cuv 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({UV_TH})>0 && V(vmin) < ({UV_TH}))
Xd_cuv c_cuv s_cuv BQ76952_DLY TD={UV_DLY}
Bq_cuv q_cuv 0 V = V(f_cuv)>0.5 && (V(vmin) > ({UV_TH+UV_HYS}))
Xr_cuv q_cuv r_cuv BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_cuv s_cuv r_cuv nact f_cuv BQ76952_SR
* OCC
Bc_occ c_occ 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OCC_TH})>0 && V(SRP,SRN) > ({OCC_TH}))
Xd_occ c_occ s_occ BQ76952_DLY TD={OCC_DLY}
Bq_occ q_occ 0 V = V(f_occ)>0.5 && (V(isns) < ({OCC_REC}))
Xr_occ q_occ r_occ BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_occ s_occ r_occ nact f_occ BQ76952_SR
* OCD1
Bc_ocd1 c_ocd1 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OCD1_TH})>0 && V(SRP,SRN) < ({-OCD1_TH}))
Xd_ocd1 c_ocd1 s_ocd1 BQ76952_DLY TD={OCD1_DLY}
Bq_ocd1 q_ocd1 0 V = V(f_ocd1)>0.5 && (V(isns) > ({OCD_REC}))
Xr_ocd1 q_ocd1 r_ocd1 BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_ocd1 s_ocd1 r_ocd1 nact f_ocd1 BQ76952_SR
* OCD2
Bc_ocd2 c_ocd2 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OCD2_TH})>0 && V(SRP,SRN) < ({-OCD2_TH}))
Xd_ocd2 c_ocd2 s_ocd2 BQ76952_DLY TD={OCD2_DLY}
Bq_ocd2 q_ocd2 0 V = V(f_ocd2)>0.5 && (V(isns) > ({OCD_REC}))
Xr_ocd2 q_ocd2 r_ocd2 BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_ocd2 s_ocd2 r_ocd2 nact f_ocd2 BQ76952_SR
* OCD3
Bc_ocd3 c_ocd3 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OCD3_TH})>0 && V(SRP,SRN) < ({-OCD3_TH}))
Xd_ocd3 c_ocd3 s_ocd3 BQ76952_DLY TD={OCD3_DLY}
Bq_ocd3 q_ocd3 0 V = V(f_ocd3)>0.5 && (V(isns) > ({OCD_REC}))
Xr_ocd3 q_ocd3 r_ocd3 BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_ocd3 s_ocd3 r_ocd3 nact f_ocd3 BQ76952_SR
* SCD
Bc_scd c_scd 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({SCD_TH})>0 && V(SRP,SRN) < ({-SCD_TH}))
Xd_scd c_scd s_scd BQ76952_DLY TD={SCD_DLY}
Bq_scd q_scd 0 V = V(f_scd)>0.5 && (1)
Xr_scd q_scd r_scd BQ76952_DLY TD={SCD_REC}
Xl_scd s_scd r_scd nact f_scd BQ76952_SR
* OTC
Bc_otc c_otc 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OT_EN})>0.5 && V(tmax) > ({OTC_TH}))
Xd_otc c_otc s_otc BQ76952_DLY TD={OTC_DLY}
Bq_otc q_otc 0 V = V(f_otc)>0.5 && (V(tmax) < ({OTC_TH-T_HYS}))
Xr_otc q_otc r_otc BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_otc s_otc r_otc nact f_otc BQ76952_SR
* OTD
Bc_otd c_otd 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({OT_EN})>0.5 && V(tmax) > ({OTD_TH}))
Xd_otd c_otd s_otd BQ76952_DLY TD={OTD_DLY}
Bq_otd q_otd 0 V = V(f_otd)>0.5 && (V(tmax) < ({OTD_TH-T_HYS}))
Xr_otd q_otd r_otd BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_otd s_otd r_otd nact f_otd BQ76952_SR
* UTC
Bc_utc c_utc 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({UT_EN})>0.5 && V(tmin) < ({UTC_TH}))
Xd_utc c_utc s_utc BQ76952_DLY TD={UTC_DLY}
Bq_utc q_utc 0 V = V(f_utc)>0.5 && (V(tmin) > ({UTC_TH+T_HYS}))
Xr_utc q_utc r_utc BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_utc s_utc r_utc nact f_utc BQ76952_SR
* UTD
Bc_utd c_utd 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && (({UT_EN})>0.5 && V(tmin) < ({UTD_TH}))
Xd_utd c_utd s_utd BQ76952_DLY TD={UTD_DLY}
Bq_utd q_utd 0 V = V(f_utd)>0.5 && (V(tmin) > ({UTD_TH+T_HYS}))
Xr_utd q_utd r_utd BQ76952_DLY TD={REC_TIME}
Xl_utd s_utd r_utd nact f_utd BQ76952_SR

* ---- permanent fail (cleared only by power-on reset) ----
Bc_sov c_sov 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({SOV_TH})>0 && V(vmax) > ({SOV_TH})
Xd_sov c_sov s_sov BQ76952_DLY TD={SOV_DLY}
Bc_suv c_suv 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({SUV_TH})>0 && V(vmin) < ({SUV_TH})
Xd_suv c_suv s_suv BQ76952_DLY TD={SUV_DLY}
Bc_fin c_fin 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({FUSE_PF_EN})>0.5 && V(f_pf)<0.5 && V(FUSE,VSS) > 2
Xd_fin c_fin s_fin BQ76952_DLY TD=0.1
Bs_pf s_pf 0 V = V(s_sov)>0.5 || V(s_suv)>0.5 || V(s_fin)>0.5
Xl_pf s_pf zero npwr f_pf BQ76952_SR
Bfuse VSS FUSE I = (V(f_pf)>0.5 && ({FUSE_BLOW})>0.5) ?
+ (min(7, V(BAT,VSS)-1.75) - V(FUSE,VSS))/1k : 0

* ---- FET control logic ----
Bcfo cfo 0 V = (({CFETOFF_MODE})==1 && V(CFETOFF,VSS)>0.9) || (({CFETOFF_MODE})==2 && V(CFETOFF,VSS)<0.9)
+ || (({DFETOFF_MODE})==3 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)>0.9) || (({DFETOFF_MODE})==4 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)<0.9)
Bdfo dfo 0 V = (({DFETOFF_MODE})==1 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)>0.9) || (({DFETOFF_MODE})==2 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)<0.9)
+ || (({DFETOFF_MODE})==3 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)>0.9) || (({DFETOFF_MODE})==4 && V(DFETOFF,VSS)<0.9)
Bchf chg_flt 0 V = V(f_cov)>0.5 || V(f_occ)>0.5 || V(f_otc)>0.5 || V(f_utc)>0.5 || V(f_pf)>0.5
Bdsf dsg_flt 0 V = V(f_cuv)>0.5 || V(f_ocd1)>0.5 || V(f_ocd2)>0.5 || V(f_ocd3)>0.5
+ || V(f_scd)>0.5 || V(f_otd)>0.5 || V(f_utd)>0.5 || V(f_pf)>0.5
Bchok chg_ok 0 V = V(rdy)>0.5 && ({FET_EN})>0.5 && V(chg_flt)<0.5 && V(cfo)<0.5
Bdsok dsg_ok 0 V = V(rdy)>0.5 && ({FET_EN})>0.5 && V(dsg_flt)<0.5 && V(dfo)<0.5
* precharge mode
Bpc_s pc_s 0 V = ({PCHG_EN})>0.5 && V(vmin) < ({PCHG_START})
Bpc_r pc_r 0 V = V(vmin) > ({PCHG_STOP})
Xpcm pc_s pc_r nact pcm BQ76952_SR
Bchm chg_m 0 V = V(chg_ok)>0.5 && V(pcm)<0.5
Bpcc pchg_c 0 V = V(chg_ok)>0.5 && V(pcm)>0.5
* predischarge
Xpdt dsg_ok pd_t BQ76952_DLY TD={PDSG_TO}
Bdsm dsg_m 0 V = V(dsg_ok)>0.5 && (({PDSG_EN})<0.5 || V(pd_t)>0.5 || V(VC16,LD) < ({PDSG_DELTA}))
Bpdc pdsg_c 0 V = V(dsg_ok)>0.5 && ({PDSG_EN})>0.5 && V(dsg_m)<0.5
* body-diode protection (series FETs)
Bchc chg_c 0 V = V(chg_m)>0.5 || (({SERIES})>0.5 && V(rdy)>0.5 && V(f_pf)<0.5 && V(dsg_m)>0.5 && V(isns) < ({-BD_TH}))
Bdsc dsg_c 0 V = V(dsg_m)>0.5 || (({SERIES})>0.5 && V(rdy)>0.5 && V(f_pf)<0.5 && (V(chg_m)>0.5 || V(pchg_c)>0.5) && V(isns) > ({BD_TH}))
* 1 us smoothing of driver commands
Rchs chg_c chg_s 1k
Cchs chg_s 0 1n
Rdss dsg_c dsg_s 1k
Cdss dsg_s 0 1n
Rpcs pchg_c pchg_s 1k
Cpcs pchg_s 0 1n
Rpds pdsg_c pdsg_s 1k
Cpds pdsg_s 0 1n

* ---- charge pump (CP1 cap to BAT) and high-side NFET drivers ----
Bcpe cpe 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({CP_EN})>0.5
Bcp  BAT CP1 I = V(cpe)>0.5 ? min(100u, max(0, (({VCP}) - V(CP1,BAT))/10k)) : V(BAT,CP1)/1Meg
Bchon  CP1 CHG I = V(chg_s)*V(CP1,CHG)*0.5*(1+tanh(V(CP1,CHG)/0.05))/200
Bchoff CHG BAT I = (1-V(chg_s))*V(CHG,BAT)/1k
Bdson  CP1 DSG I = V(dsg_s)*V(CP1,DSG)*0.5*(1+tanh(V(CP1,DSG)/0.05))/200
* DSG turn-off: sink to VSS, regulated so DSG stops at the LD (PACK+) level
Bdsoff DSG VSS I = (1-V(dsg_s))*V(DSG,LD)*0.5*(1+tanh(V(DSG,LD)/0.1))/50
* PCHG / PDSG PFET drivers: sink up to 30 uA toward max(PACK,BAT)-8.4 V
Bpchg PCHG VSS I = V(pchg_s)>0.5 ? min(30u, max(0, 1e-4*(V(PCHG,VSS) - max(0, max(V(PACK,VSS),V(BAT,VSS))-8.4)))) : 0
Bpdsg PDSG VSS I = V(pdsg_s)>0.5 ? min(30u, max(0, 1e-4*(V(PDSG,VSS) - max(0, max(V(LD,VSS),V(BAT,VSS))-8.4)))) : 0

* ---- digital outputs ----
Bany any_f 0 V = V(chg_flt)>0.5 || V(dsg_flt)>0.5
Balrt ALERT VSS I = (({ALERT_EN})>0.5 && V(any_f)>0.5 && V(act)>0.5) ? V(ALERT,VSS)/100 : 0
Bvh  vh 0 V = V(act)>0.5 ? (({REG1_V})>0 ? V(REG1,VSS) : V(REG18,VSS)) : 0
Bddsg VSS DDSG I = ({DDSG_EN})>0.5 ? ((V(dsg_flt)>0.5 ? V(vh) : 0) - V(DDSG,VSS))/100 : 0
Bdchg VSS DCHG I = ({DCHG_EN})>0.5 ? ((V(chg_flt)>0.5 ? V(vh) : 0) - V(DCHG,VSS))/100 : 0

* ---- autonomous cell balancing ----
Bcba cb_ok 0 V = V(act)>0.5 && ({CB_EN})>0.5 && V(isns) > ({-CB_IDSG})
Bcbn cb_n 0 V = V(cb_ok) < 0.5
Bbs1 bs1 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE1})>0.5 && V(cm1) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm1)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr1 br1 0 V = V(cm1)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb1 bs1 br1 cb_n b1 BQ76952_SR
Bcb1 VC1 VC0 I = (V(b1)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC1,VC0)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs2 bs2 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE2})>0.5 && V(cm2) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm2)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr2 br2 0 V = V(cm2)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb2 bs2 br2 cb_n b2 BQ76952_SR
Bcb2 VC2 VC1 I = (V(b2)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC2,VC1)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs3 bs3 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE3})>0.5 && V(cm3) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm3)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr3 br3 0 V = V(cm3)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb3 bs3 br3 cb_n b3 BQ76952_SR
Bcb3 VC3 VC2 I = (V(b3)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC3,VC2)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs4 bs4 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE4})>0.5 && V(cm4) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm4)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr4 br4 0 V = V(cm4)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb4 bs4 br4 cb_n b4 BQ76952_SR
Bcb4 VC4 VC3 I = (V(b4)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC4,VC3)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs5 bs5 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE5})>0.5 && V(cm5) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm5)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr5 br5 0 V = V(cm5)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb5 bs5 br5 cb_n b5 BQ76952_SR
Bcb5 VC5 VC4 I = (V(b5)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC5,VC4)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs6 bs6 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE6})>0.5 && V(cm6) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm6)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr6 br6 0 V = V(cm6)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb6 bs6 br6 cb_n b6 BQ76952_SR
Bcb6 VC6 VC5 I = (V(b6)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC6,VC5)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs7 bs7 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE7})>0.5 && V(cm7) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm7)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr7 br7 0 V = V(cm7)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb7 bs7 br7 cb_n b7 BQ76952_SR
Bcb7 VC7 VC6 I = (V(b7)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC7,VC6)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs8 bs8 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE8})>0.5 && V(cm8) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm8)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr8 br8 0 V = V(cm8)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb8 bs8 br8 cb_n b8 BQ76952_SR
Bcb8 VC8 VC7 I = (V(b8)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC8,VC7)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs9 bs9 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE9})>0.5 && V(cm9) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm9)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr9 br9 0 V = V(cm9)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb9 bs9 br9 cb_n b9 BQ76952_SR
Bcb9 VC9 VC8 I = (V(b9)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC9,VC8)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs10 bs10 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE10})>0.5 && V(cm10) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm10)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr10 br10 0 V = V(cm10)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb10 bs10 br10 cb_n b10 BQ76952_SR
Bcb10 VC10 VC9 I = (V(b10)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC10,VC9)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs11 bs11 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE11})>0.5 && V(cm11) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm11)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr11 br11 0 V = V(cm11)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb11 bs11 br11 cb_n b11 BQ76952_SR
Bcb11 VC11 VC10 I = (V(b11)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC11,VC10)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs12 bs12 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE12})>0.5 && V(cm12) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm12)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr12 br12 0 V = V(cm12)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb12 bs12 br12 cb_n b12 BQ76952_SR
Bcb12 VC12 VC11 I = (V(b12)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC12,VC11)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs13 bs13 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE13})>0.5 && V(cm13) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm13)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr13 br13 0 V = V(cm13)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb13 bs13 br13 cb_n b13 BQ76952_SR
Bcb13 VC13 VC12 I = (V(b13)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC13,VC12)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs14 bs14 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE14})>0.5 && V(cm14) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm14)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr14 br14 0 V = V(cm14)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb14 bs14 br14 cb_n b14 BQ76952_SR
Bcb14 VC14 VC13 I = (V(b14)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC14,VC13)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs15 bs15 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE15})>0.5 && V(cm15) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm15)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr15 br15 0 V = V(cm15)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb15 bs15 br15 cb_n b15 BQ76952_SR
Bcb15 VC15 VC14 I = (V(b15)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC15,VC14)/({RCB}) : 0
Bbs16 bs16 0 V = V(cb_ok)>0.5 && ({CE16})>0.5 && V(cm16) > ({CB_MINV}) && V(cm16)-V(vmin) > ({CB_START})
Bbr16 br16 0 V = V(cm16)-V(vmin) < ({CB_STOP})
Xb16 bs16 br16 cb_n b16 BQ76952_SR
Bcb16 VC16 VC15 I = (V(b16)>0.5 && V(mwin)<0.5) ? V(VC16,VC15)/({RCB}) : 0
Bcbany cbany 0 V = V(b1)>0.5 || V(b2)>0.5 || V(b3)>0.5 || V(b4)>0.5 || V(b5)>0.5 || V(b6)>0.5 || V(b7)>0.5 || V(b8)>0.5 || V(b9)>0.5 || V(b10)>0.5 || V(b11)>0.5 || V(b12)>0.5 || V(b13)>0.5 || V(b14)>0.5 || V(b15)>0.5 || V(b16)>0.5

